  "title": "Avoid Overspending by Reframing Small Amounts",
  "description": "Avoid overspending by reframing small amounts. Here’s how: - Think in totals: Ask, “How much will this add up to?” - Group small spends: View multiple small expenses as one big expense. - Pause before paying: Small denominations might tempt you—take a moment to reconsider. Example: Spending $5 here and $3 there adds up quickly. Think about the bigger picture before parting with cash.",
